sonic is back with a new friend and a  new foe in sonic the hedgehog 2. and a  familiar voice is bringing the blue  blur's new friend tails to life on the  big screen here's everything else you  need to know before you see sonic the  hedgehog 2.  let's do this even after it was almost  derailed by a set of eerily  human-looking teeth the film adaptation  of sega's beloved mascot was a hit both  with fans of the games and at the box  office earning nearly 320 million  dollars worldwide although critics felt  there was some room for improvement the  zippy design of sonic himself and the  likable cast of human characters were  enough to have the film declared the  rare successful video game adaptation  just three months after the release of  the first movie variety confirmed that  sonic the hedgehog 2 was officially on  the way with director jeff fowler and  screenwriters pat casey and josh miller  all returning in the first film we're  introduced to sonic an alien hedgehog  who uses a dimension bending ring to  travel to earth once there he's pursued  by the evil dr robotnik who wants to  harness sonic's supersonic speed for use  in his robotics experiments sonic teams  up with sheriff tom and his wife maddie  in order to evade dr robotnik's  increasingly menacing attempts to  capture the hedgehog sonic the hedgehog  was enjoyable and did justice to the  games but it also left lots of room to  go bigger and better with another  installment now that we know one is on  the way let's dig into the details of  what we know about the release date cast  and plot of the upcoming sonic the  hedgehog 2. when paramount made the  announcement about the sequel it was  just that news and not much else however  in late july 2020 the studio revealed  the official release date for sonic the  hedgehog 2. ben schwartz who voices the  speedy little hedgehog posted to his  twitter account a video of himself  confirming the news the video simply  featured sorts strolling beside massive  promotional posters for sonic the  hedgehog while awkwardly explaining what  he was seeing the caption of the video  is where the actor made things crystal  clear sonic 2 is officially coming to  theaters april 8 2022 one of the biggest  drinks of the first sonic the hedgehog  was its cast bin schwartz best known for  parks and recreation and the after party  and an avowed fan of the original sonic  games gave an energetic vocal  performance as the titular hedgehog jim  carrey was delightfully unhinged as the  villainous doctor robotnik while james  marsden and tikka sumter provided the  right balance of humor and heart as  sonic's unassuming human allies all four  actors will reprise their roles in sonic  the hedgehog 2. colleen o'shaughnessy  who voiced tales in the sonic games  performed the character's dialogue in a  brief post-credits sequence that sets up  tails to be a much more prominent part  of the next film and o'shaughnessy will  return there are two new big names in  the cast of sonic the hedgehog 2. in  june 2021 shimar moore well known for  his work on cbs procedurals criminal  minds and swat posted to instagram a  picture of himself on the sonic 2 set  with the other primary members of the  human cast he announced his casting but  didn't reveal any details about his  character however moore briefly appears  in a scene in the third sonic the  hedgehog 2 trailer in august 2021  variety reported that emmy and  oscar-nominated superstar idris elba had  joined sonic the hedgehog 2 as the voice  of knuckles a sonic adversary turned  ally in the 90's sega games during the  2021 game awards sonic the hedgehog 2  voice actor ben schwartz introduced the  first trailer for the film with a second  teaser arriving in time for the 2022  super bowl both clips revealed a few  details about the plot of the highly  anticipated sequel after sonic blasted  away dr robotnik to a mushroom planet in  the first film he was determined to  escape his prison and return to earth as  revealed in the third trailer which hit  the internet on march 14th dr robotnik  returns to wreak more havoc and he's in  possession of a giant green emerald  which he proclaims to be the source of  ultimate power sonic after crashing  through a ring portal on a pile of snow  rudely interrupting a hawaiian  destination wedding announces his  intention to stop his persistent nemesis  or otherwise the world is doomed neither  side is alone in their quest this time  dr robotnik has brought along the  destructive and nefarious in kidna  knuckles while sonic has tails fighting  in his corner overall the sonic sequel  looks like it has much more in common  with the games that inspired the movie  with familiar faces on a new adventure  hopefully everyone will love  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies and tv shows are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]
 

